1
00:00:06,297 --> 00:00:10,069
OmniDoc answers questions about your PDFs, scans, contracts and spreadsheets.

2
00:00:10,319 --> 00:00:24,754
Every claim cites the page it came from, and every sentence is checked against its source.

3
00:00:25,004 --> 00:00:34,588
Extract fields, compare versions, find personal data and explore a knowledge graph.

4
00:00:34,838 --> 00:00:38,100
Measured on public benchmarks, with answers from free models.

5
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:43,371
Built entirely on free tiers, and open source. Feedback reaches the author by e-mail.

6
00:00:43,621 --> 00:00:48,901
Try it without an account: a sample library of five documents.

7
00:00:49,151 --> 00:00:57,160
A short guided tour shows new users around the workspace.

8
00:00:57,410 --> 00:01:01,303
Ask in plain words.

9
00:01:01,553 --> 00:01:03,735
Agents retrieve passages, read the tables, look for conflicts and write the answer. (Sped up.)

10
00:01:03,985 --> 00:01:07,890
Every figure is cited, and the table it came from is shown with the query that read it.

11
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:13,441
Click a citation: the page opens with the supporting sentence highlighted.

12
00:01:13,691 --> 00:01:18,063
And each sentence of the answer is checked against the passages it cites.

13
00:01:18,313 --> 00:01:26,887
Ask and get answers in ten languages.

14
00:01:27,137 --> 00:01:36,518
Search every passage in the library, without a model call.

15
00:01:36,768 --> 00:01:40,058
The library: every document with its pages, summary, tables and fields.

16
00:01:40,308 --> 00:01:46,031
Every table found in the documents, as data you can open and download.

17
00:01:46,281 --> 00:01:51,479
Every date in the library, in order, each linked to its page.

18
00:01:51,729 --> 00:01:58,338
A privacy scan finds Aadhaar, PAN, card and phone numbers, and makes redacted copies.

19
00:01:58,588 --> 00:02:11,700
People, companies and places linked across the library, on a globe you can search.

20
00:02:11,950 --> 00:02:22,070
Make it yours: light, dark or system theme, accent colours, text size and motion.

